{
    "title": "Hertz Rent-a-Car Deals - Easy!",
    "description": "Save time and get on the road faster with the free Hertz\u00ae rental car app for Android. Unlock the power to reserve, modify and review your reservations with a few swipes of your finger; helping you spend less time in lines so you can get to your destination quicker. Easy car rental reservations for business trips, family vacations or any other travel you are planning!\r\n\r\nDownload the Hertz Android App to get immediate access to all these features:\r\n\u2022 Skip the hassle of other car rental apps with Hertz\u2019s one-touch app log-in.\r\n\u2022 Enjoy effortless updated mobile navigation and menus.\r\n\u2022 Book your next rent-a-car faster by using your previous saved searches.\r\n\u2022 Find a Hertz location near you, anywhere in the world easily - Listings include hours of operation, contact information, and directions to the location.\r\n\u2022 Get access to exclusive offers and content with Hertz Gold Plus Rewards\u00ae app integration.\r\n\u2022 And much more\u2026\r\n\r\nWhat benefits do you get with the Hertz Gold Plus Rewards program?\r\n\u2022 Earn Hertz Rewards points, unlock rental car perks and score exclusive travel benefits to earn free car rental days, free upgrades and more.\r\n\u2022 Sign up is 100% free in the Android app, helping you start earning rewards faster.\r\n\u2022 Enjoy a personalized in-app experience with your name, member number, status, and car rental rewards points balance all in one convenient location.\r\n\u2022 See upcoming reservations at log-in or access your complete Hertz car rental history to make new bookings and help you complete expense reports.\r\n\u2022 Easily review or modify upcoming car rentals with a few swipes.\r\n\u2022 Redeem, request and exchange Hertz Rewards Points to pay for your car rental directly from the app.\r\n\u2022 Save, modify and update your preferred payment method with ease. Save work or personal creditcards for easy travel bookings for your business or personal travel.\r\n\r\nDid You Know\u2026\r\n\r\nIn 2020, Hertz Gold Plus Rewards was voted the best car rental rewards program by FlyerTalk.com, an online website with over 750,000 members, 30 million posts and earning 20 million page views per month. Why is this a big deal? Because at a time where COVID was making companies cut back, Hertz invested in its Gold Plus Rewards program, giving weary travelers a great rental experience in not-so-great times. Hertz is privileged to serve great customers like you, and our work to improve your overall car rental experience, we\u2019ve been recognized for those efforts.\r\n\r\nThank you for being the motivation for Hertz to achieve these great awards:\r\n\u2022 Women\u2019s Choice Award \u2013 Best Car Rental Loyalty Program\r\n\u2022 Ethisphere Institute Award - World\u2019s Most Ethical Company - 2020\r\n\u2022 Recommend Readers\u2019 Choice Award \u2013 Best Car Rental Company (7x Winner)\r\n\u2022 FlyerTalk Awards \u2013 Best Car Rental Loyalty Program (8x Winner)\r\n\u2022 AAA Discounts and Rewards \u2013 Outstanding AAA Partner of the Year (2x Winner)\r\n\u2022 Trazee Awards \u2013 Favorite Car Rental Company\r\n\u2022 Global Traveler Award \u2013 Best Car Rental Company (6x Winner)\r\n\u2022 Bitacora Award \u2013 Best National Car Rental Company (7x Winner)\r\n\u2022 Annual World Travel Awards \u2013 Favorite Car Rental Company\r\n\u2022 And many more, but the greatest award is our customers\u2019 satisfaction!\r\n\r\nLearn More About Hertz:\r\n\r\nThe Hertz Corporation is much more than a rental car business -We are a company that prides itself on dedication to our customers' changing needs by offering a wide variety of vehicles and services. We boast a rich history of significant first steps, ambitious ideas and innovation that has formed our company into the reputable brand it is today. Discover why millions of travel customers every year trust Hertz for their rental car needs.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Save time and get on the road faster with the free Hertz\u00ae rental car app for Android. Unlock the power to reserve, modify and review your reservations with a few swipes of your finger; helping you spend less time in lines so you can get to your destination quicker. Easy car rental reservations for business trips, family vacations or any other travel you are planning!<br><br>Download the Hertz Android App to get immediate access to all these features:<br>\u2022 Skip the hassle of other car rental apps with Hertz\u2019s one-touch app log-in.<br>\u2022 Enjoy effortless updated mobile navigation and menus.<br>\u2022 Book your next rent-a-car faster by using your previous saved searches.<br>\u2022 Find a Hertz location near you, anywhere in the world easily - Listings include hours of operation, contact information, and directions to the location.<br>\u2022 Get access to exclusive offers and content with Hertz Gold Plus Rewards\u00ae app integration.<br>\u2022 And much more\u2026<br><br>What benefits do you get with the Hertz Gold Plus Rewards program?<br>\u2022 Earn Hertz Rewards points, unlock rental car perks and score exclusive travel benefits to earn free car rental days, free upgrades and more.<br>\u2022 Sign up is 100% free in the Android app, helping you start earning rewards faster.<br>\u2022 Enjoy a personalized in-app experience with your name, member number, status, and car rental rewards points balance all in one convenient location.<br>\u2022 See upcoming reservations at log-in or access your complete Hertz car rental history to make new bookings and help you complete expense reports.<br>\u2022 Easily review or modify upcoming car rentals with a few swipes.<br>\u2022 Redeem, request and exchange Hertz Rewards Points to pay for your car rental directly from the app.<br>\u2022 Save, modify and update your preferred payment method with ease. Save work or personal creditcards for easy travel bookings for your business or personal travel.<br><br>Did You Know\u2026<br><br>In 2020, Hertz Gold Plus Rewards was voted the best car rental rewards program by FlyerTalk.com, an online website with over 750,000 members, 30 million posts and earning 20 million page views per month. Why is this a big deal? Because at a time where COVID was making companies cut back, Hertz invested in its Gold Plus Rewards program, giving weary travelers a great rental experience in not-so-great times. Hertz is privileged to serve great customers like you, and our work to improve your overall car rental experience, we\u2019ve been recognized for those efforts.<br><br>Thank you for being the motivation for Hertz to achieve these great awards:<br>\u2022 Women\u2019s Choice Award \u2013 Best Car Rental Loyalty Program<br>\u2022 Ethisphere Institute Award - World\u2019s Most Ethical Company - 2020<br>\u2022 Recommend Readers\u2019 Choice Award \u2013 Best Car Rental Company (7x Winner)<br>\u2022 FlyerTalk Awards \u2013 Best Car Rental Loyalty Program (8x Winner)<br>\u2022 AAA Discounts and Rewards \u2013 Outstanding AAA Partner of the Year (2x Winner)<br>\u2022 Trazee Awards \u2013 Favorite Car Rental Company<br>\u2022 Global Traveler Award \u2013 Best Car Rental Company (6x Winner)<br>\u2022 Bitacora Award \u2013 Best National Car Rental Company (7x Winner)<br>\u2022 Annual World Travel Awards \u2013 Favorite Car Rental Company<br>\u2022 And many more, but the greatest award is our customers\u2019 satisfaction!<br><br>Learn More About Hertz:<br><br>The Hertz Corporation is much more than a rental car business -We are a company that prides itself on dedication to our customers&#39; changing needs by offering a wide variety of vehicles and services. We boast a rich history of significant first steps, ambitious ideas and innovation that has formed our company into the reputable brand it is today. Discover why millions of travel customers every year trust Hertz for their rental car needs.",
